2025-09-30 21:00:39,235 [WARNING] Skipped idx=560: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='The expression of TAP73 and DeltaNP73 in malignant gliomas. In these conditions, JTV519 (K201), a 1,4-benzothiazepine derivative and multi-channel blocker, stabilizes RyR2s and decrease SR Ca²⁺ leak. The study describes the differential expression of TAp73 (transcriptionally active) and DeltaNp73 (dominant-negative) isoforms of the p73 gene in normal brain tissues and glial tumors. TAp73 is up-regulated in high-grade glial tumors, while DeltaNp73 is expressed at lower levels. This expression pattern is associated with the inactivation of the retinoblastoma pathway, leading to the activation of E2F transcription factors, which is a key molecular mechanism in tumor progression. TAp73, as a downstream target of E2F1, plays a significant role in this process. Therefore, the identification of TAp73 as an isoform of p73 is supported by its well-documented involvement in the regulation of gene expression and cellular processes in the context of cancer.'
